OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 200 rural crimes
OL,4,A'extremely worrying'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor says reports of more than
OL,7,F200 crimes in rural areas are extremely
OL,8,Fworrying.
OL,10,FAccording to data from Northumbria
OL,11,FPolice's public alerts, 211 reports
OL,12,Fhave been made between 1 January and 11
OL,13,FOctober 2026 relating to farming,
OL,14,Fforestry and wildlife crimes in
OL,15,FNorthumberland.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
