OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 200 rural crimes
OL,4,A'extremely worrying'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRothbury councillor Steven Bridgett has
OL,7,Fmapped the reports and said crime
OL,8,F"disrupted livelihoods" and victims
OL,9,F"feared" offenders would return. Farmer
OL,10,FJohn Moffatt said nothing had been
OL,11,Ftaken from his farm but men in
OL,12,Fbalaclavas loitering at night had
OL,13,Fcaused "unrest at lambing".
OL,15,FNorthumbria Police said it was
OL,16,F"committed to tackling rural crime and
OL,17,Funderstand the devastating impact it
OL,18,Fhad on people's livelihoods".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
